# The packaged skill is compared byte for byte by the installer and by the
# installation evaluation, and its frontmatter is matched line by line, so
# everything checks out with the same line endings on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
# The bench's ESP32 images are committed as built and held against their
# manifest's SHA-256, so no checkout may touch a byte of them.
*.bin binary
